@startuml
' AmbuDock — System Architecture Overview (Bilingual / no overlap)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam linetype ortho
hide stereotype

title AmbuDock — System Architecture Overview\n(시스템 아키텍처 개요)

' ---------- ROW #1 : Client & External ----------
together {
  package "Client (클라이언트)" {
    [WebApp (React)] as WEB
  }

  cloud "External Data Sources (외부 데이터 소스)" as EXT {
    [NMC ER/ICU API\n(60s)] as NMC
    [MOIS Alerts\n(180s)] as MOIS
    [Kakao Local / Reverse Geo] as KAKAO
    [TMAP Routing REST] as TMAP
  }
}

' ---------- ROW #2 : Backend Core ----------
together {
  package "Backend (AmbuDock)" as BE {
    [API Gateway\n/Public API] as API

    package "Ingestion & Harmonization\n(수집·정합 파이프라인)" {
      [A1 Master Onboarding\n(Kakao)] as A1
      [A2 Status Loader\n(60s)] as A2
      [A3 HLI Calculator\n(60s)] as A3
      [A4 Disaster Ingest\n(180s)] as A4
      [A5 Alert↔Region Mapper] as A5
    }

    package "Routing Proxy\n(경로 프록시)" {
      [TMAP Proxy\nPOST /api/tmap/route] as PROXY
    }

    package "Admin (운영)" {
      [AppConfig Service] as CFG
      [Admin API] as ADM
    }

    database "Operational DB\n(운영 DB)" as DB
    collections "Cache (Redis)\n(선택)" as CACHE
    [Audit / Score Log\n(감사/점수 로그)] as AUDIT
  }
}

' ================== FLOWS (short numeric labels) ==================
' Ingestion / compute
NMC  --> A2 : F1
A2   --> DB : F2
A3   --> DB : F3
A3   --> AUDIT : F4
DB   --> A3 : F5
MOIS --> A4 : F6
A4   --> DB : F7
A4   --> A5 : F8
A5   --> DB : F9
KAKAO--> A1 : F10
A1   --> DB : F11

' Public API
WEB --> API : F12
API --> DB  : F13
API --> WEB : F14

WEB --> API : F15
API --> DB  : F16
API --> WEB : F17

WEB --> API : F18
API --> DB  : F19
API --> WEB : F20

WEB --> PROXY : F21
PROXY --> TMAP : F22
PROXY --> WEB  : F23

' Admin / config / cache
ADM --> CFG : F24
CFG --> API : F25
CFG --> A2  : F26
CFG --> A4  : F27
CFG --> PROXY : F28
API --> CACHE : F29

' -------------------- LEGEND --------------------
legend right
**Flow Legend (흐름 설명)**

F1  NMC → A2 : Real-time status pull (60s) / 실시간 상태 수집
F2  A2 → DB : upsert HospitalStatus
F3  A3 → DB : upsert HliSnapshot (latest 1:1) / 최신 스냅샷 저장
F4  A3 → AUDIT : score/penalty/reason log / 점수·감점·사유 로그
F5  DB → A3 : read status (HLI input) / HLI 입력 데이터

F6  MOIS → A4 : alert fetch (180s) / 재난문자 수집
F7  A4 → DB : upsert DisasterAlert (TTL,is_active)
F8  A4 → A5 : region tokens / 지역 토큰 전달
F9  A5 → DB : upsert AlertRegionMap

F10 Kakao → A1 : geocode/reverse / 지오코딩·역지오코딩
F11 A1 → DB : upsert Hospital (addr/region) / 병원 마스터 정합

F12 WEB → API : GET /api/hospitals (주변 병원)
F13 API → DB : read hospitals + HLI
F14 API → WEB : list + HLI summary / 목록 + 요약

F15 WEB → API : POST /api/disasters/evaluate (hpids[])
F16 API → DB : read alerts/regions
F17 API → WEB : blocked · severity · badges

F18 WEB → API : GET /api/hospitals/{hpid} (detail)
F19 API → DB : read ER/ICU detail (hv2..hv6,hvoc, icu_avail)
F20 API → WEB : hospital detail payload

F21 WEB → PROXY : POST /api/tmap/route
F22 PROXY → TMAP : delegate route/ETA / 경로·ETA 위임
F23 PROXY → WEB  : ETA / route_km / line_km

F24 AdminAPI → AppConfig : mutate params / 파라미터 변경
F25..F28 CFG → components : thresholds/intervals/timeout / 임계·주기·타임아웃 주입
F29 API → CACHE : use cache (optional) / 캐시 사용(선택)
endlegend

' -------------------- NOTES --------------------
note right of A3
HLI Calculator (60s)
- score = ER(hvec) + ICU adjust
- level = GREEN / YELLOW / RED / GRAY
- lag_sec = now - hvidate
- save latest 1:1 (per hpid)
(HLI 계산: 60초 주기)
- 점수 = 응급실 가용 + ICU 보정
- 레벨 = G/Y/R/GRAY, 신선도 lag_sec
- 병원별 최신 1:1 보관
end note

note right of PROXY
TMAP Proxy (경로 프록시)
- input: origin + K≤10 dest × {car,walk}
- output: ETA, route_km, line_km
- cache 2m, timeout 1.5s
end note

note right of DB
Core Tables (핵심 테이블)
- Hospital(hpid, name_norm, lat, lon, addr_road, region_code)
- HospitalStatus(hpid, hvidate, hvec, hv2..hv6, hvoc)
- HliSnapshot(status_id FK, score, level, lag_sec, reason[])
- DisasterAlert(id, issued_at, msg, severity, ttl, is_active)
- AlertRegionMap(alert_id, region_code)
- AppConfig(thresholds, intervals, penalties, K, radius_default)
end note
@enduml
